{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "14df1a79c20e943a2a4f71d1b4fe051a4c9221ab1d9a8e9f978fbf430cbd1d52", "ja": "（恵美とバラエティ番組の収録に来ている。\n今しがた、リハーサルが終わったところだ）", "zh": "（我和惠美来录制综艺节目。\n刚刚才结束彩排。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "5e76f6def834faef770326faace117419005bff1bd6d5ade798a0c7b7249cf9b", "ja": "ふぅ～、かなり本格的なリハだったね！\n楽しかったけど……難しそうだな～。", "zh": "呼～，刚才的彩排还真是相当正式呢！\n虽然很开心……但感觉好难啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "ba44ae3bb01954563d6cfaa4dacab6617151efede4c9a4c14f6cc2c7ba47596b", "ja": "すっごいヌルヌルするから、\nちょっと気を抜いたら落ちちゃうかも。", "zh": "因为实在太滑了，稍微一放松警惕，说不定就会掉下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4db0685b8b235bb1a1dd588de9c6aaacf38489f1eaffe92f815855ee11e969bf", "ja": "そうだな、風花は何度も落ちてたしな……。\n今、シャワーに行ってるのか？", "zh": "是啊，风花都掉下去好几次了……  \n她现在是去洗澡了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "c6f84e546993c401a3ef64de9a05465f6bcd67c86b2e2940014d459851a8103f", "ja": "うん、「足を引っ張ってごめん」ってへこんでた。\n風花、気にしすぎなんだよな～。", "zh": "嗯，她还消沉地说“拖大家后腿了，对不起”。\n风花就是太容易想多啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7828105c219b1b2de6768b7681dfda86de5631beaf22902968e9c207ce747971", "ja": "風花に、無理はしないようにって言っておかないとな。\nあ、もちろん恵美もだぞ。", "zh": "我得提醒风花别勉强自己。啊，当然也包括惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "61e5ed82b817af2981262a9b12e6854f1a58185c6912283e9a15a3d840df7473", "ja": "大丈夫！　アタシ、けっこうバランス感覚いいんだ♪\n毎日チャリ乗ってるからかな～？", "zh": "没问题！我的平衡感可是很不错的哦♪\n可能是因为每天都骑自行车吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "f2e7966822836bc656ab1ea7bcfd3b34d8c602bb1db664294a4572cd2533740a", "ja": "つまりこれって、アタシ向けの番組だと思うんだよね。\nすっごい活躍しちゃうから、期待してて！", "zh": "也就是说，我觉得这节目就是为我量身定做的。我要大显身手一番，你就期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a71e816813e5411cb425a2c68e9f207345853e99dc9fc63e01ca1e4270bf8547", "ja": "まあ、うん……でも、ほどほどでいいんじゃないか？\nなかなかハードみたいだし、ケガが心配だよ。", "zh": "嗯，也是……不过，适可而止就好吧？\n看起来相当辛苦，我有点担心你会受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "62acb2a7df3df93cdd99ed77fe7122836f8c33106ccc8ff82d92b033dcc56fc7", "ja": "う～ん、心配してくれるのは嬉しいけど……。\n今回は、どうしても優勝したいんだよね。", "zh": "嗯～你愿意为我担心，我很高兴……不过这次，我无论如何都想赢得冠军。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4eacf335eb60191220d74e55721a61f25416472564adfbec8a7d6ae3a49683ac", "ja": "だってさ～……風花あの感じだと、\n優勝逃したら、めっちゃ気にしそうじゃん？", "zh": "因为啊～……看风花那副样子，要是没能夺冠，她肯定会特别在意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "e5217a913de8efd1c767a310bcea76462627cb5cdcb06d73bbf3e6184057e4aa", "ja": "「私が足を引っ張らなきゃ優勝できたのに～」って。\nだったらここは、アタシが一肌脱がなきゃでしょ！", "zh": "“要是我没拖后腿的话，本来是能拿冠军的～”这样。\n既然如此，这时候本姑娘就不得不挺身而出了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "518800001a62f7bf057ee3d71f636b132ba4f4f8c786977e52a8f492edae655b", "ja": "恵美……。そんなことを思ってたのか。", "zh": "惠美……原来你一直在想这种事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "75a2a7860a5a1f9733826e7d8e5c746e4a1f00fde0126aac1800a724428e3ddc", "ja": "にゃはは♪　まあ、ただアタシが\n全力で楽しみたいだけ、ってのもあるけど。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪不过，也有一部分原因是我只是想尽情享受而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "158e3fa60cdefbd73253ed60cefe7d36bfd4d32f1351ef20787b0b1a33e1a035", "ja": "だから、絶対に優勝して、トロフィーもらってくる！\nってことで、応援よろしくね♪", "zh": "所以，我一定要拿下冠军，把奖杯带回来！\n那么，拜托你为我加油啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8c0a5bc613c928405527598dea75b68cd5e88b2a92fb2495cdf6f1366bdf4938", "ja": "そうか……、恵美の気持ちはよくわかった。それなら\n掛ける言葉はひとつだけだ。必ず優勝してこい！", "zh": "原来如此……我明白惠美的心情了。既然这样，我要说的话只有一句。一定要拿下冠军回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "a11f818c612d4fba8567a0a3d4dfa1a0bcdd09f2689f7c7965e96e0bb8217579", "ja": "オッケー！　あ、優勝したら、個人的なお祝いして\nもらっちゃおうかな？　なんてね、にゃはは♪", "zh": "好！啊，要是拿了冠军，能不能给我来个私人庆祝？开玩笑的啦，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0214_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9fd0cc54933ca9266351b02f67d50c6b7066218da8f1392b7b5c27191047a647", "ja": "（仲間のために。それが恵美の原動力なのかもしれ\nないな……よし、俺も全力で応援するぞ！）", "zh": "（为了同伴。那或许就是惠美的动力所在吧……好，我也要全力为她加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
